{
  "$defs": {
    "Event": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "一个离散事件（Event 表的一行）。\n\n- `event` / `spec_hash`：产出它的事件定义（版本化，内容哈希绑定参数）；\n- `event_time`：可观测时间（见模块文档）；\n- `attributes`：事件的描述性内容（方向、前后状态、阈值……）；\n- `input_ids`：所用输入点的 `point_id`，严格升序；`upstream_event_ids`：所用上游事件的\n  `event_id`，严格升序；两者至少一个非空；\n- `event_id`：以上内容的哈希，构造时复核（不接受自报的哈希）。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
        },
        "spec_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Spec Hash",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "event_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Event Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "attributes": {
          "additionalProperties": false,
          "patternProperties": {
            "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$": {
              "anyOf": [
                {
                  "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
                  "type": "string"
                },
                {
                  "type": "integer"
                },
                {
                  "type": "boolean"
                },
                {
                  "type": "string"
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "title": "Attributes",
          "type": "object"
        },
        "input_ids": {
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Input Ids",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "upstream_event_ids": {
          "default": [],
          "items": {
            "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
            "type": "string"
          },
          "title": "Upstream Event Ids",
          "type": "array"
        },
        "event_id": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Event Id",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "event",
        "spec_hash",
        "event_time",
        "event_id"
      ],
      "title": "Event",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "EventInputPoint": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "上游序列上的一个点：一个 Feature 值或 State 标签（ADR-0036 §1）。\n\n- `source`：`kind=feature` 或 `kind=state` 的引用；序列身份即 `str(source)`；\n- `source_lineage_hash`：该点来源的哈希（例如上游规格 + 数据集 + Provider + 该时刻的值，见\n  `infrastructure.event.inputs`）；只能依赖 `available_time` 时已知的信息，因此过去的点与\n  引用它们的事件的身份不随未来数据改变；\n- `evaluation_time`：该值所描述的时刻；`available_time`：它可被观测的最早时刻，不早于\n  `evaluation_time`；\n- `value`：`None` 表示上游显式\"不可计算\"；State 标签以非数值文本给出。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "source": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
        },
        "source_lineage_hash": {
          "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
          "title": "Source Lineage Hash",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "evaluation_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Evaluation Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "available_time": {
          "format": "date-time",
          "title": "Available Time",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "value": {
          "anyOf": [
            {
              "pattern": "^(?!^[-+.]*$)[+-]?0*\\d*\\.?\\d*$",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "integer"
            },
            {
              "type": "boolean"
            },
            {
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "type": "null"
            }
          ],
          "title": "Value"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "source",
        "source_lineage_hash",
        "evaluation_time",
        "available_time",
        "value"
      ],
      "title": "EventInputPoint",
      "type": "object"
    },
    "Kind": {
      "description": "可版本化对象的类型（02-domain.md §1）。",
      "enum": [
        "dataset",
        "representation",
        "feature",
        "state",
        "event",
        "outcome",
        "strategy",
        "risk",
        "cost_model",
        "experiment",
        "hypothesis",
        "knowledge",
        "artifact",
        "profile",
        "profile_selection_rule"
      ],
      "title": "Kind",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "Ref": {
      "additionalProperties": false,
      "description": "对象引用：`{kind}:{name}@{version}`。",
      "properties": {
        "schema_version": {
          "default": "2.1.0",
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Schema Version",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "kind": {
          "$ref": "#/$defs/Kind"
        },
        "name": {
          "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_]*$",
          "title": "Name",
          "type": "string"
        },
        "version": {
          "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
          "title": "Version",
          "type": "string"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "kind",
        "name",
        "version"
      ],
      "title": "Ref",
      "type": "object"
    }
  },
  "additionalProperties": false,
  "description": "一次事件识别请求：截至 `as_of` 的事件表。\n\n- `event` 必须是 `kind=event` 的引用，`spec_hash` 为该 `EventSpec` 的内容哈希；\n- `inputs`：按 `(available_time, source, evaluation_time)` 规范排序；\n  `(source, evaluation_time)` 重复即拒绝；每条序列只追加（同一 source 按 `evaluation_time`\n  排序后 `available_time` 不递减）；\n- `upstream_events`：交互算子的上游事件，按 `(event_time, event_id)` 规范排序，`event_id` 唯一。\n\n同一请求内容 → 同一 `content_hash()`（输入顺序不影响）。",
  "properties": {
    "schema_version": {
      "default": "2.1.0",
      "pattern": "^(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*)(?:-(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*)(?:\\.(?:0|[1-9][0-9]*|[0-9]*[a-zA-Z-][0-9a-zA-Z-]*))*)?(?:\\+[0-9a-zA-Z-]+(?:\\.[0-9a-zA-Z-]+)*)?$",
      "title": "Schema Version",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "event": {
      "$ref": "#/$defs/Ref"
    },
    "spec_hash": {
      "pattern": "^[0-9a-f]{64}$",
      "title": "Spec Hash",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "as_of": {
      "format": "date-time",
      "title": "As Of",
      "type": "string"
    },
    "inputs": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/EventInputPoint"
      },
      "title": "Inputs",
      "type": "array"
    },
    "upstream_events": {
      "default": [],
      "items": {
        "$ref": "#/$defs/Event"
      },
      "title": "Upstream Events",
      "type": "array"
    }
  },
  "required": [
    "event",
    "spec_hash",
    "as_of"
  ],
  "title": "EventRequest",
  "type": "object"
}
